ssh-tpm-agent (0.8.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. (Closes: #1082814: ITP: ssh-tpm-agent -- ssh-agent
    for TPMs)

  * Key provisioning by Certificate Authority (CA) was disabled.

    This functionality depends on the ssh-tpm-ca-authority project,
    which at the time of writing is still considered a work-in-progress
    by its author and has no stable releases.

    See 0001-disable-ca-support.patch.

  * Deadline setting for tests was increased in
    0003-increase-tests-deadline.patch

